{"mode":"words","text":"Nå skal du lytte til teksten og lese den samtidig. Som nybegynner leser du betydningslinjen på morsmålet ditt, lytter til målspråket i rolig tempo og trykker ofte på pause — slik knytter hjernen din lyden til betydningen. Som viderekommen leser du originalteksten og ser bare raskt ned når du støter på ukjente ord. Bruk gjerne A-B-gjentakelsen: Merk av en enkelt setning og la den gå i loop – prøv det ovenfor.","words":[{"s":0,"e":232},{"s":267,"e":499},{"s":534,"e":615},{"s":662,"e":917},{"s":987,"e":1138},{"s":1173,"e":1741},{"s":1858,"e":1927},{"s":1997,"e":2415},{"s":2450,"e":2775},{"s":2984,"e":4063},{"s":4690,"e":4981},{"s":5074,"e":5817},{"s":5898,"e":6397},{"s":6432,"e":6513},{"s":6594,"e":7860},{"s":7953,"e":8092},{"s":8173,"e":8835},{"s":8870,"e":9427},{"s":9520,"e":9950},{"s":9985,"e":10124},{"s":10170,"e":11064},{"s":11099,"e":11134},{"s":11180,"e":11575},{"s":11610,"e":12295},{"s":12922,"e":13131},{"s":13166,"e":13642},{"s":13711,"e":14013},{"s":14083,"e":14210},{"s":14292,"e":15023},{"s":15186,"e":15441},{"s":16289,"e":16858},{"s":17067,"e":17601},{"s":17635,"e":18123},{"s":18286,"e":18541},{"s":18657,"e":19203},{"s":19319,"e":19621},{"s":19714,"e":20840},{"s":21989,"e":22256},{"s":22337,"e":23231},{"s":23348,"e":23847},{"s":23882,"e":23951},{"s":24021,"e":25298},{"s":25426,"e":25542},{"s":25611,"e":25902},{"s":25971,"e":26308},{"s":26378,"e":26923},{"s":27005,"e":27446},{"s":27608,"e":27852},{"s":27899,"e":28003},{"s":28050,"e":28630},{"s":28711,"e":28851},{"s":28944,"e":29524},{"s":29605,"e":30070},{"s":31219,"e":31683},{"s":31753,"e":32218},{"s":32310,"e":34191},{"s":35341,"e":35770},{"s":35851,"e":35933},{"s":36002,"e":36072},{"s":36165,"e":36594},{"s":36664,"e":37303},{"s":37419,"e":37523},{"s":37593,"e":37837},{"s":37906,"e":38046},{"s":38115,"e":38348},{"s":38394,"e":38429},{"s":38510,"e":38882},{"s":39125,"e":39160},{"s":39404,"e":39776},{"s":39857,"e":39961},{"s":40031,"e":41192}]}